# SLD notebooks

- Never edit notebooks under `src/Object Detection/SLD Training/Results/`. That folder is run output.
- Editable SLD notebooks are `notebooks/kaggle-sld-pipeline.ipynb` (both stages) and `notebooks/kaggle-sld-stage-b.ipynb` (stage B only, classifier loaded from GitHub).
- Kaggle accepts ipynb uploads up to 1 MB. Keep that notebook thin: new logic goes in the `.py` files it calls, not in new notebook cells.
